  "description": "SEA ISLE WATER TOWER ☀️\n\nYou know you're back when you spot the famous \"Smile You're In Sea Isle\"  water tower.\n\nThere's something about seeing that water tower that makes it feel like summer has officially started. You're back in Sea Isle, the bags are unpacked (maybe), and the beach is calling.\n\nThis original Weathered Thread design features the embroidered Sea Isle City water tower—a familiar sight for anyone who knows and loves this town. Whether you've been coming here for years or just starting the tradition, it's a little piece of Sea Isle worth keeping close.\n\nWear it on your way down the shore, around town, or while counting the days until you're back.\n\nTHE DETAILS\n\n• Original Weathered Thread embroidery design\n• Embroidered directly onto your selected garment\n• Made to order\n• Quality Comfort Colors® garment\n• Soft, substantial feel with the lived-in character of a favorite piece\n• Available in multiple garment styles, colors, and sizes  \n• Unisex fit\n• Don't see what you want? Send a message!\n\n\nCHOOSE YOUR PIECE\n\nSelect your garment style, color, and size from your choice of Comfort Colors® tee, long-sleeve tee, or crewneck. Choose from the listing options.\n\nEach piece is embroidered to order and finished individually. Because of this, slight variations in stitch texture or placement may occur. These small variations are part of the character of a handmade piece made just for you.\n\nMade to Remember. Stitched in.",
